cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Christos: a local reaction prediction system with source-aware input resolution and provenance"
abstract: >-
  A local reaction prediction system that resolves Chinese medicine herb and
  formula names to concrete compound seeds, enumerates products with reaction
  templates, and records the source record, template and condition evidence
  behind every candidate. Ships a desktop interface, a command-line bridge and
  the benchmark data needed to reproduce the published numbers.
